<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f5f7; padding: 32px;">
  <table style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;">
    <tr>
      <td>
        <h2 style="color: #111;">Verify your email</h2>
        <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
        <p>Use the code below to verify your Pennytor account. This code expires in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 6px; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; color: #1a1a1a;">
          {{otp}}
        </p>
        <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">
          If you didn't create a Pennytor account, you can safely ignore this email.
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
